    "body": "The current implementation is aiming to identify any of the following common semantic-release placeholders:\r\n- `0.0.0-semantically-released`\r\n- `0.0.0-semantic-versioning`\r\n- `0.0.0-semantic-release`\r\n\r\nDo you know of any packages that currently have the `semantic` identifier in their version, and aren't using semantic-release?",
