    "body": "Was thinking about this when I wrote this originally actually\r\n\r\nMy thinking was if they had `semantic` in a version like this then it's arguably still more likely (albeit speculative) that  they were using semantic versioning than not with something like `1.4.21-foo-semantic-bar` - though not sure how we'd be able to explain the `1.4.21`\r\n\r\nOpen to tweak it or keep the same, what do you think @matchai ?",
